 Step File Name : export.step(10761 ents)  Write  Done

    ✔ creates usable tray supports before CAD (2178ms)
    ✔ retains the candidate set across automatic redistribution (814ms)
    ✔ reports a manual contact in a switch opening without deleting it (390ms)

  Reusable footprint tools
    ✔ derives one envelope from all transformed cached models and keeps missing bounds unchecked
    ✔ groups electrical pads by number and leaves mechanical pads separate
    ✔ exports a standalone CommonJS module preserving geometry and mapped nets
    ✔ flips board layers, local coordinates and pad orientations on the back
    ✔ keeps unknown constructs but refuses unsafe transforms explicitly
    ✔ requires a unique target and preserves all unrelated bytes when binding models
    ✔ identifies a chosen emission independently of per-placement references
    ✔ updates multiple models on a routed board and accepts legacy single bindings
    ✔ wraps dynamic modules without changing their params, body branches or unrelated code

  Footprint refresh engine boundaries
    ✔ keeps F&B shorthand literal while evaluating finite numeric expressions
    ✔ rejects nonfinite and malformed explicit numeric values
    ✔ reports unresolved net metadata and preserves intentionally empty nets
    ✔ includes blank copper pads and preserves shared original net groups
    ✔ keeps unrelated blank copper pads separate and maps shared numbered pads together
    ✔ retains native backend rejection of unknown numeric net IDs
    ✔ roundtrips saved mappings for blank copper groups through native export
    ✔ exports imported copper pads to distinct native nets without stale IDs

  Footprint preview geometry
    ✔ exposes custom jumper copper and oval drill geometry independently
    ✔ converts adjacent board copper into the selected footprint local frame
    ✔ reports unsupported pad primitives and board-only zones without a fake footprint
    ✔ inspects real controller copper and holes after native engine generation (346ms)
    ✔ classifies legacy F&B copper pads without promoting NPTH holes

  Filter
    ✔ without points
    ✔ empty filter
    ✔ similar

  Solid enclosures

